<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis eternal life to know Him,</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>Think, oh, think how much we owe Him,</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>With His precious blood He bought us,</l><l>In the wilderness He sought us,</l><l>To His flock He safely brought us:</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Blessed Jesus! would you know Him?</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>Give yourselves entirely to Him,</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>Think no longer of the morrow,</l><l>From the past new courage borrow,</l><l>Jesus carries all your sorrow:</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>All your sins shall be forgiven,</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>Backward shall your foes be driven,</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l><l>Best of blessings He’ll provide you,</l><l>Nought but good shall e’er betide you,</l><l>Safe to glory He will guide you:</l><l>Oh, how He loves!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
